<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ARCHIVE // 0x00</title>
    <style>
        /* Import retro monospace font */
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap');

        :root {
            --bg-color: #050505;
            --text-color: #a3a3a3;
            --dim-color: #4a4a4a;
            --highlight-color: #8ab4f8; /* Cold terminal blue glow */
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            /* Edge vignette effect */
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #0a0a0a 0%, #000000 100%);
        }

        /* Global old-style scanline effect */
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%, 
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 50%
            );
            background-size: 100% 4px;
            z-index: 10;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* Slowly downward-scrolling light band */
        body::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -100%; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                transparent 0%,
                rgba(138, 180, 248, 0.03) 50%,
                transparent 100%
            );
            animation: scan 8s linear infinite;
            z-index: 11;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @keyframes scan {
            0% { top: -100%; }
            100% { top: 100%; }
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 700px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 20;
        }

        /* Top marker */
        .header-mark {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--dim-color);
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Text area */
        .data-block {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            line-height: 2.5;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            text-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(163, 163, 163, 0.2);
            /* Subtle screen breathing flicker */
            animation: flicker 4s infinite alternate;
        }

        /* Slightly emphasize the special symbols */
        .data-block span {
            color: var(--highlight-color);
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Bottom marker and cursor */
        .footer-mark {
            margin-top: 60px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--dim-color);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 8px;
            height: 15px;
            background-color: var(--dim-color);
            margin-left: 8px;
            animation: blink 1.2s step-end infinite;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        @keyframes flicker {
            0%, 19%, 21%, 23%, 25%, 54%, 56%, 100% {
                opacity: 1;
                text-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(163, 163, 163, 0.2);
            }
            20%, 24%, 55% {
                opacity: 0.8;
                text-shadow: none;
            }
        }

        /* Add a faint index-like feel before each number */
        .eq-num {
            color: var(--dim-color);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header-mark">
        <span>DATA_FRAGMENT: 001</span>
        <span>STATUS: ENCRYPTED</span>
    </div>

    <div class="data-block">
<span class="eq-num">[01]</span> 1. zomat <span>×</span> genus = zaruk mē
<span class="eq-num">[02]</span> 2. natsu mē goraiva + limē vhena 
       = goraiva mē sirin
<span class="eq-num">[03]</span> 3. e londe kodhr mē vhena - kodhr mē genus
       = sirin mē zaruk
<span class="eq-num">[04]</span> 4. sirin mē vos <span>÷</span> goraiva = limē kodhr
<span class="eq-num">[05]</span> 5. vhena londe vi natsu + zaruk mē zomat
       = vhena londe zomat mē vos
<span class="eq-num">[06]</span> 6. (ni sirin ni e vhena + ni sirin ni e kodhr) 
       <span>×</span> limē genus = limē
    </div>

    <div class="footer-mark">
        <span>DECRYPTION REQUIRED</span>
        <span class="cursor"></span>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
